Z||000001||ferg||01-22-2001||11:16 AM||||Welcome to the arm-pit of the nation! I'm only 10 minutes from Porter and there are quite a few junkyards in this area. I'm not sure how many yards are in Chesterton, but Valparaiso has 2 big yards and one smaller yard. I haven't been to the junkyards for some time so I don't know what type of inventory they have. As for other yards- Lake County has a few as well. If you are really desperate, Chicago is only a few minutes away, and I'm sure you could get something there. Hope this helps||||reg||1
